><surname>Kyle</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>1989</year><article-title>A late Pleistocene molluscan assemblage from Lake Nhlange, Zululand, and its palaeoenvironmental implications.</article-title><source>S Afr J Geol</source><volume>92</volume><fpage>73</fpage><lpage>83</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000614-Compton1"><label>6</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Compton</surname><given-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><year>2001</year><article-title>Holocene sea-level fluctuations inferred from the evolution of depositional environments from the southern Langebaan Lagoon salt marsh, South Africa.</article-title><source>The Holocene</source><volume>11</volume><fpage>395</fpage><lpage>405</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000614-Kilburn1"><label>7</label><citation citation-type="book"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kilburn</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Rippey</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><year>1982</year><article-title>Sea Shells of Southern Africa.</article-title><publisher-loc>Macmillan, Johannesburg, South Africa</publisher-loc></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000614-Bolton1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Bolton</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Anderson</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>1990</year><article-title>Correlation between intertidal seaweed community composition and sea water temperature patterns on a geographic scale.</article-title><source>Bot Mar</source><volume>33</volume><fpage>447</fpage><lpage>457</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000614-Emanuel1"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Emanuel</surname><given-names>BP</given-names></name><name><s